Subject: [PATCH 14/22] docs(verify): state that runs under Codex are not
 receipted (E3d)

The Codex manifest loads no hooks, so Codex writes no approvals or receipts and nothing records
the host. Documented in the verify skill; E3's Scope, Acceptance and Tests reshaped to match, and
its Status set to partial ((b) Snakemake rule inputs not done).
